From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bpereira <bpereira@cloudflare.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 13:09:33 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Rebuild derived table-cell and list-marker state at paint
 instead of storing it

A table cell's grid styles and a list marker's outside position are derived from the box tree and
the resolved style. Rebuild them where paint reads them rather than storing a copy on every node
that may never be painted, and shape an outside list marker when it is painted.
